      "h": "Mandative subjunctive uses the base form of the verb (bare infinitive) regardless of subject person.",
      "e": "The mandative subjunctive following verbs of demand/insistence/recommendation ('insisted that...') requires the base form of the verb ('resign', NOT 'resigns' or 'will resign'), even with a third-person singular subject.",
      "step": "Step 1: Recognize mandative subjunctive trigger: 'insisted that...'.\nStep 2: Subjunctive verb form = bare infinitive (base form).\nStep 3: 'resign' is correct, omitting the indicative '-s'.",
