      "q": "[Family Tree Problems Arrangement #5] Eight executives (A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H) sit around a circular conference table facing the center. A sits third to the right of B. F sits second to the right of A. C is not an immediate neighbor of B. D sits second to the left of C. E sits to the immediate left of H. Who sits diametrically opposite to B?",
