      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "q": "Determine the final displacement and direction from the point of origin:\nAn autonomous field robot travels 14 meters North, turns 90 degrees clockwise and advances 11 meters East, turns right again and moves 14 meters South. Finally, it pivots 90 degrees counter-clockwise and drives 11 meters East. How far and in what direction is the robot from its initial origin?",
