      "e": "North displacement of 14 m is completely cancelled by South displacement of 14 m. The two Eastward legs sum to 11 + 11 = 22 m East.",
      "step": "Step 1: North-South displacement: +14 - 14 = 0.\nStep 2: East-West displacement: +11 + 11 = +22 m.\nStep 3: Final position: 22 m East.",
