      "e": "M + K means M is sister of K. K / N means K is mother of N. Therefore, M is the maternal aunt of N.",
      "step": "Step 1: Decouple mapping transformation rule.\nStep 2: Apply invariant mapping to test item.\nStep 3: Confirmed result is 'M + K / N'.",
      "tech": "Symbolic operational constraint mapping.",
