      "topic": "Cause and Effect",
      "difficulty": "Medium",
      "q": "[Cause and Effect Pattern #1] In a code language, if 'SYSTEM' is coded as 'SYSMET' and 'NEARER' is coded as 'AENRER', how is 'FRACTION' coded?",
