      "q": "[Calendar-Based Reasoning Syllogism #1] Evaluate the syllogism premises:\nPremise 1: All quantum processors are superconductors.\nPremise 2: Some superconductors are high-frequency oscillators.\nWhich conclusion logically and definitively follows?",
