      "h": "Count total odd days up to 1946 years + odd days in 1947 up to 15 August.",
      "e": "1600 years = 0 odd days. 300 years = 1 odd day. 46 years = 11 leap years + 35 ordinary years = 11*2 + 35*1 = 57 odd days = 1 odd day. Total odd days up to 1946 = 1 + 1 = 2. Days in 1947: Jan(3) + Feb(0) + Mar(3) + Apr(2) + May(3) + Jun(2) + Jul(3) + Aug 15(1) = 17 days = 3 odd days. Total odd days = 2 + 3 = 5. Day 5 is Friday.",
      "step": "Step 1: Period 0 to 1600: 0 odd days.\nStep 2: 1601 to 1900: 1 odd day.\nStep 3: 1901 to 1946: 11 leap + 35 ordinary = 57 days = 1 odd day.\nStep 4: 1947 (Jan-Aug 15): 31+28+31+30+31+30+31+15 = 227 days = 3 odd days.\nStep 5: Total = 1 + 1 + 3 = 5 odd days = Friday.",
      "tech": "Zeller/Odd days calendar modular arithmetic.",
      "formula": "",
