      "topic": "Pattern Recognition",
      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "q": "[Pattern Recognition Sets #3] In a group of 50 researchers, 30 are proficient in Python, 25 are proficient in C++, and 10 are proficient in neither. How many researchers are proficient in BOTH Python and C++?",
